== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vdpphps [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0x52]
     LENGTH:  8
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AVX512
    ISA-SET: AVX512_VNNI_FP16_512
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E4
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_SIB HAS_EVEX ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 72 6C 50 52 4C 88 40 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT      RW     MODRM_REG    512     16      32   FLOAT32                         zmm9
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R          MASK     64     64       1       INT                           k0
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD    512     16      32   FLOAT16                        zmm18
 3     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     32      1      32   FLOAT16  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                 rcx
                                                                                 SCALE =                   4
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000100
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 512
  BROADCAST: 1_TO_16
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k0 [DISABLED]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vdpphps 0x100(%rax,%rcx,4) {1to16}, %zmm18, %zmm9
   RELATIVE: vdpphps 0x100(%rax,%rcx,4) {1to16}, %zmm18, %zmm9

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vdpphps zmm9, zmm18, dword ptr ds:[rax+rcx*4+0x100] {1to16}
   RELATIVE: vdpphps zmm9, zmm18, dword ptr ds:[rax+rcx*4+0x100] {1to16}

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
62 72 6C 50 52 4C 88 40 
:           :  :  :  :..DISP
:           :  :  :..SIB
:           :  :..MODRM
:           :..OPCODE
:..EVEX
